.TH NEOFETCH 1 "January 2026" "neofetch-c 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
neofetch \- display system information with ASCII art
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B neofetch
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B neofetch
collects basic system information such as operating system, kernel,
uptime, packages, display, and hardware details, then prints the results
next to a colorized ASCII logo for the detected distribution. The binary
comes from the neofetch-c project, a fast reimplementation of the original
bash-based neofetch utility.
.PP
The current build focuses on sensible defaults and does not expose command
line options or configuration files. Simply run the command to display the
summary.
.SH EXIT STATUS
The command exits with status 0 when information is displayed successfully.
A non-zero status indicates an unexpected failure while gathering data.
.SH AUTHORS
Written by Alexia Michelle.
